  "Question": "In \\(\\odot O\\), \\(\\angle AOB=100^\\circ\\), and point \\(C\\) lies on minor arc \\(AB\\). Find the measure of \\(\\angle ACB\\) (unit: degrees).",
  "Choices": {},
